id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b007:l009","ordinal":328158,"en":"This is a lie."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b007:l010","ordinal":328159,"en":"Let's listen, listen to your blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b007:l011","ordinal":328160,"en":"All my people listen!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l001","ordinal":328161,"en":"Your grandfather is lost,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l002","ordinal":328162,"en":"Having a day of humiliation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l003","ordinal":328163,"en":"We entered the settlement and got better."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l004","ordinal":328164,"en":"We became men while strolling,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l005","ordinal":328165,"en":"We were equal to the enemy."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l006","ordinal":328166,"en":"We broke the stone and moved."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l007","ordinal":328167,"en":"We fought and took revenge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l008","ordinal":328168,"en":"We took Talas fort,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l009","ordinal":328169,"en":"It seems that he is a very hostile man"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l010","ordinal":328170,"en":"We took revenge from Kanchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0424:b008:l011","ordinal":328171,"en":"We bought Talas land for settlement."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l001","ordinal":328172,"en":"Blessed are you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l002","ordinal":328173,"en":"You opened my eyes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l003","ordinal":328174,"en":"When you opened your mouth, you kissed me."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l004","ordinal":328175,"en":"You took care of everything,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l005","ordinal":328176,"en":"You saved more than a person."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l006","ordinal":328177,"en":"Put yourself slowly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l007","ordinal":328178,"en":"Take the gap."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l008","ordinal":328179,"en":"I have no dreams for God"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l009","ordinal":328180,"en":"Be a father."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l010","ordinal":328181,"en":"You are a hero, you are a hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l011","ordinal":328182,"en":"You are braver than the universe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l012","ordinal":328183,"en":"The remaining widows and orphans"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l013","ordinal":328184,"en":"You are the one who can wait."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l014","ordinal":328185,"en":"You are the wing that makes black,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l015","ordinal":328186,"en":"You are the belt that ties the belt,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l016","ordinal":328187,"en":"You are my place to stay."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l017","ordinal":328188,"en":"You are a blessing that made me sad,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l018","ordinal":328189,"en":"You are my father."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l019","ordinal":328190,"en":"There is no relative to take care of."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l020","ordinal":328191,"en":"There is no relative apart from yourself."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0425:b002:l021","ordinal":328192,"en":"Let the goose become a pet,"}]
